<title>USA: Cypress Bioscience stake raised by group.</title>
<headline>Cypress Bioscience stake raised by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Paramount Capital Asset Management Inc said on Monday it raised its stake in Cypress Bioscience Inc to 7.5 percent or 2,267,134 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 45,000 additional shares of Cypress between Octcober 17 and 29 at prices ranging from $2.188 to $2.438 a share.</p>
<p>The New York-based group said it holds its stake in the San Diego-based medical device maker for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
